<title>BELGIUM: Belgian region to invest in Charleroi Airport.</title>
<headline>Belgian region to invest in Charleroi Airport.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's Walloon regional government said on Thursday it would invest 250 million Belgian francs in Charleroi Airport in 1997.</p>
<p>The investment would be used to renovate buildings owned by Belgian aerospace firm Sabca and links between parking and terminal areas, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
